Separate third-party terms and dependencies
  - The RFC 9421 Appendix B.1.4 test key (test-key-ed25519) used to sign the
    fixtures comes from RFC 9421 (IETF Trust) and is not Marketfauna's. It is a
    public test key; never trust it in production. Its PEM/JWK representations
    are supplied under the IETF terms below; CC0 and MIT do not replace them.
  - make_fixtures.py imports Marketfauna's wba.py (site/tools/wba.py), which is
    not included in this grant.

